WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.324 --> 00:00:02.726
there, be careful with that

00:00:02.859 --> 00:00:03.827
stuff if it watches ashore.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:04.761
Local officials want to make

00:00:04.895 --> 00:00:07.297
sure they get that word out.

00:00:07.431 --> 00:00:07.864
Thank you very much.

00:00:07.998 --> 00:00:11.968
&gt;&gt;&gt; Let's bring in Leon Panetta,

00:00:12.336 --> 00:00:13.437
former CIA director under

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.338
president Obama.

00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:15.772
Just about everything here in

00:00:15.906 --> 00:00:16.340
Washington.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.174
He's always great when he comes

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:19.910
on with us.

00:00:20.344 --> 00:00:20.644
Leon, thanks so much for being

00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:20.977
with us.

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:22.746
We appreciate it.

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:23.313
Let me ask you this,

00:00:23.447 --> 00:00:24.348
congressional source tells thus

00:00:24.481 --> 00:00:27.818
there will be a briefing for the

00:00:27.951 --> 00:00:29.753
so-called gang of eight

00:00:29.886 --> 00:00:31.054
lawmakers and the key

00:00:31.188 --> 00:00:31.788
intelligence committee members

00:00:31.922 --> 00:00:32.356
as you know.

00:00:32.422 --> 00:00:34.524
The Navy is in the process of

00:00:34.658 --> 00:00:35.892
recovering the spy balloon

00:00:36.026 --> 00:00:36.927
surveillance equipment, what do

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.463
you think they're going to find?

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:40.831
Do you think they'll find much

00:00:40.964 --> 00:00:43.367
that is useful?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.370
&gt;&gt; Well, that's a very important

00:00:46.436 --> 00:00:47.804
briefing that ought to be

00:00:47.938 --> 00:00:53.377
provided to our congressional

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:53.710
leaders.

00:00:53.844 --> 00:00:55.779
Particularly if it's confirmed

00:00:55.912 --> 00:00:57.981
that this balloon had the

00:00:58.382 --> 00:01:01.918
capability to pick up sensitive

00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:03.587
information and was an

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.390
intention-gathering mission, was

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.892
on an intelligence-gathering

00:01:09.025 --> 00:01:09.226
mission.

00:01:09.359 --> 00:01:12.396
And secondly, whether it was

00:01:12.396 --> 00:01:12.662
maneuverable.

00:01:12.796 --> 00:01:16.466
If it is a spy balloon, if it's

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.602
maneuverable, then clearly

00:01:18.735 --> 00:01:20.404
invading U.S. Air space was of

00:01:20.404 --> 00:01:20.937
concern and I think the

00:01:21.071 --> 00:01:22.406
president made the right

00:01:22.472 --> 00:01:24.408
decision to shoot it down.

00:01:24.408 --> 00:01:27.411
So there's an awful lot of

00:01:27.544 --> 00:01:29.880
information we need to know in

00:01:30.013 --> 00:01:31.648
order to confirm or worst

00:01:31.782 --> 00:01:32.048
suspicions.

00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:33.216
&gt;&gt; And you've been in the

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:34.684
position of defense secretary,

00:01:34.818 --> 00:01:36.486
CIA director, white house chief

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.422
of staff.

00:01:38.422 --> 00:01:40.424
Would you have advised the

00:01:40.424 --> 00:01:41.391
president to shoot down the

00:01:41.525 --> 00:01:43.026
balloon immediately, as soon as

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.862
it was becoming noticeable over

00:01:45.996 --> 00:01:46.997
the skies in Montana or do you

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.066
think it made some sense from an

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:50.667
intelligence-gathering

00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:52.469
standpoint to let it drift for

00:01:52.602 --> 00:01:54.438
awhile and let it get out over

00:01:54.571 --> 00:01:55.639
the ocean where it can be

00:01:55.772 --> 00:01:57.307
brought down without any really

00:01:57.441 --> 00:02:02.446
potential for danger below?

00:02:02.579 --> 00:02:03.146
&gt;&gt; Well, you know, there are

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.348
going to be lessons from all of

00:02:05.482 --> 00:02:08.618
this with regards to this kind

00:02:08.752 --> 00:02:11.087
of spy balloon if, it is, in

00:02:11.221 --> 00:02:12.823
fact, a spy balloon.

00:02:12.956 --> 00:02:14.558
If it was that, and if we were

00:02:14.691 --> 00:02:17.794
aware of the balloon, I think we

00:02:17.928 --> 00:02:20.464
should have taken steps to

00:02:20.497 --> 00:02:21.298
prevent it from entering our air

00:02:21.431 --> 00:02:23.266
space and I'm not sure that we

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.770
should have allowed it to simply

00:02:26.903 --> 00:02:29.806
crossover the country, crossover

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.775
what were obviously sensitive

00:02:31.908 --> 00:02:32.542
military sites.

00:02:32.676 --> 00:02:36.580
I don't see the logic of that.

00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:39.950
So the question obviously is --

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:41.518
the Pentagon said there were

00:02:41.651 --> 00:02:42.052
risks here.

00:02:42.486 --> 00:02:45.522
I understand that argument.

00:02:45.655 --> 00:02:48.592
There were debris risks.

00:02:48.725 --> 00:02:49.259
At the same time I think we

00:02:49.392 --> 00:02:53.029
should have acted earlier if our

00:02:53.163 --> 00:02:55.232
suspicions were valid that this

00:02:55.365 --> 00:02:57.968
was, in fact, on an intelligence

00:02:58.101 --> 00:02:58.502
mission.

00:02:58.502 --> 00:03:00.670
I hope in the future we make

00:03:00.804 --> 00:03:03.907
clear to the -- to China that

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.375
this kind of incident cannot

00:03:05.509 --> 00:03:05.942
happen again.

00:03:06.076 --> 00:03:08.178
And it will not happen again.

00:03:08.512 --> 00:03:11.147
In the future, if we see that

00:03:11.281 --> 00:03:12.549
kind of balloon, we are going

00:03:12.682 --> 00:03:15.519
to -- if they don't take action

00:03:15.652 --> 00:03:16.920
to prevent that balloon from

00:03:17.053 --> 00:03:20.524
entering our air space, that we

00:03:20.524 --> 00:03:21.091
will indeed shoot it down much

00:03:21.224 --> 00:03:21.791
earlier than we did this time

00:03:21.925 --> 00:03:22.993
around.

00:03:23.126 --> 00:03:24.928
&gt;&gt; And I think if I have you

00:03:25.061 --> 00:03:26.530
straight, you're saying that you

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.165
think this should have been shot

00:03:29.299 --> 00:03:29.966
down perhaps over Montana,

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.701
something like that, maybe over

00:03:31.935 --> 00:03:33.537
a sparsely populated area before

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:36.907
it crossed over the entire --

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.109
almost the entire continental

00:03:39.242 --> 00:03:39.409
U.S.?

00:03:39.543 --> 00:03:43.179
&gt;&gt; Yeah, that bothered me that

00:03:43.313 --> 00:03:46.550
it was allowed to transverse the

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.083
entire country.

00:03:47.217 --> 00:03:50.554
And for that reason, I think it

00:03:50.554 --> 00:03:51.354
probably would have been well

00:03:51.488 --> 00:03:55.292
for the president to have been

00:03:55.425 --> 00:03:56.092
transparent with the country

00:03:56.226 --> 00:03:58.862
about what was happening here.

00:03:58.995 --> 00:04:00.564
When they initially found that

00:04:00.564 --> 00:04:02.566
the balloon was there, when they

00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:04.701
considered it to be an

00:04:04.834 --> 00:04:05.702
intelligence-gathering balloon,

00:04:05.835 --> 00:04:08.572
and frankly, when the president

00:04:08.572 --> 00:04:09.239
made the decision to shoot it

00:04:09.372 --> 00:04:09.539
down.

00:04:09.673 --> 00:04:11.107
If he made the decision on

00:04:11.241 --> 00:04:14.578
Wednesday to shoot it down, I

00:04:14.644 --> 00:04:16.246
think that should have been made

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:16.713
public.

00:04:16.713 --> 00:04:18.114
It would have prevented some of

00:04:18.248 --> 00:04:20.584
the criticism that occurred

00:04:20.584 --> 00:04:21.017
later and the American people I

00:04:21.151 --> 00:04:22.886
think are entitled to know just

00:04:23.019 --> 00:04:24.588
exactly what our adversaries are

00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:26.590
up to.

00:04:26.623 --> 00:04:27.223
So I think greater transparency

00:04:27.357 --> 00:04:29.392
would have helped the white

00:04:29.526 --> 00:04:30.727
house as well.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.062
&gt;&gt; Our reporting indicate that

00:04:32.195 --> 00:04:34.264
is the Pentagon waited a bit to

00:04:34.598 --> 00:04:38.068
inform the president of this.

00:04:38.201 --> 00:04:40.270
Would that have rankled you a

00:04:40.604 --> 00:04:42.606
bit if you had been the white

00:04:42.639 --> 00:04:43.740
house chief of staff in the

00:04:43.873 --> 00:04:45.208
middle of all of this?

00:04:45.342 --> 00:04:46.242
&gt;&gt; You bet.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:49.112
&gt;&gt; I suspect so.

00:04:49.245 --> 00:04:51.748
&gt;&gt; I think when the defense

00:04:51.881 --> 00:04:54.117
department, when the Pentagon

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:59.356
sees a suspicious large balloon

00:04:59.489 --> 00:05:01.591
that is about to enter our air

00:05:01.725 --> 00:05:04.628
space and impact on your

00:05:04.628 --> 00:05:05.562
sovereignty, I think they have

00:05:05.695 --> 00:05:07.964
an obligation to let the

00:05:08.098 --> 00:05:10.634
president of the United States

00:05:10.634 --> 00:05:13.336
know that immediately so that he

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:19.709
can then decide what steps are

00:05:19.843 --> 00:05:21.478
going to be taken in order to

00:05:21.611 --> 00:05:22.012
protect the company.

00:05:22.145 --> 00:05:23.947
&gt;&gt; As we can see in the map, and

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.548
I can describe it to you, the

00:05:25.682 --> 00:05:26.650
Chinese balloon was spotted near

00:05:26.916 --> 00:05:29.019
a number of U.S. Military bases

00:05:29.152 --> 00:05:29.986
from Montana, through the middle

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.321
of the country, all the way over

00:05:31.454 --> 00:05:32.288
to the Carolinas.

00:05:32.656 --> 00:05:33.690
I know you probably know exactly

00:05:33.823 --> 00:05:35.692
where all those bases are.

00:05:35.825 --> 00:05:37.527
And U.S. Officials said they

00:05:37.661 --> 00:05:40.296
were taking steps to protect

00:05:40.664 --> 00:05:41.765
against foreign intelligence

00:05:41.898 --> 00:05:42.232
collection.

00:05:42.666 --> 00:05:43.867
Do you think the Pentagon could

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.135
have used electronic

00:05:45.268 --> 00:05:47.170
interference or other measures

00:05:47.303 --> 00:05:50.674
to prevent the balloon from

00:05:50.807 --> 00:05:51.408
acquiring important information?

00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:52.108
That is what the Pentagon was

00:05:52.242 --> 00:05:52.842
indicating yesterday, that they

00:05:52.976 --> 00:05:56.279
were able to mitigate this

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:56.780
somewhat.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:58.882
&gt;&gt; Well, I think it's very

00:05:59.015 --> 00:06:03.053
important to do the analysis on

00:06:03.186 --> 00:06:05.255
the technology that was aboard

00:06:05.388 --> 00:06:05.955
that balloon.

00:06:06.089 --> 00:06:11.394
We're making a lot of

00:06:11.528 --> 00:06:12.062
guesstimates at this point.

00:06:12.195 --> 00:06:12.762
It seems to me, we do need to

00:06:12.896 --> 00:06:14.698
retrieve as much of that as we

00:06:14.698 --> 00:06:17.200
can in order to determine just

00:06:17.333 --> 00:06:19.736
how sensitive the technology

00:06:19.869 --> 00:06:20.704
was.

00:06:20.837 --> 00:06:23.006
If it was in fact the kind of

00:06:23.139 --> 00:06:24.974
technology that could gather

00:06:25.108 --> 00:06:26.710
intelligence or pick up signals

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.612
of one kind or another and

00:06:29.746 --> 00:06:32.916
really obtain very sensitive

00:06:33.049 --> 00:06:34.718
information, then that raises a

00:06:34.851 --> 00:06:37.454
lot more concerns about allowing

00:06:37.587 --> 00:06:39.923
it to do that and just exactly

00:06:40.056 --> 00:06:42.225
what China will do with that

00:06:42.358 --> 00:06:42.726
information.

00:06:42.759 --> 00:06:44.027
If, in fact, it was a weather

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.395
balloon, then, I think,

00:06:45.528 --> 00:06:46.730
obviously, the world needs to

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:47.464
know that as well.

00:06:47.597 --> 00:06:50.400
So a lot is going to depend on

00:06:50.734 --> 00:06:52.135
what our intelligence officials

00:06:52.268 --> 00:06:54.738
and the FBI that look at that --

00:06:54.738 --> 00:06:58.742
at all of that equipment, what

00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:02.245
determination they make as to

00:07:02.378 --> 00:07:03.446
what in fact was involved with

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.814
this balloon.

00:07:04.948 --> 00:07:07.550
That's important for the united

00:07:07.684 --> 00:07:07.884
States.

00:07:08.017 --> 00:07:10.320
It's important for China and,

00:07:10.754 --> 00:07:11.521
frankly, it's important for the

00:07:11.654 --> 00:07:12.956
American people to know the

00:07:13.089 --> 00:07:13.423
truth.

00:07:13.556 --> 00:07:16.259
Very quickly, the Chinese

00:07:16.392 --> 00:07:17.594
response after it was shot down

00:07:17.727 --> 00:07:20.163
was pretty pointed and they seem

00:07:20.296 --> 00:07:26.069
to be objecting.

00:07:26.202 --> 00:07:27.170
Shouldn't the white house be

00:07:27.303 --> 00:07:28.805
telling the Chinese essentially

00:07:28.938 --> 00:07:32.108
to shove it?

00:07:32.242 --> 00:07:33.476
&gt;&gt; You know, we know the what,

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.880
but we really don't know the why

00:07:37.013 --> 00:07:38.782
here, Jim.

00:07:38.782 --> 00:07:41.317
Why would China do something

00:07:41.451 --> 00:07:42.418
like this?

00:07:42.786 --> 00:07:44.053
They obviously knew that the

00:07:44.187 --> 00:07:46.022
balloon would be detected.

00:07:46.156 --> 00:07:49.092
They knew that the United States

00:07:49.225 --> 00:07:51.394
would respond.

00:07:51.528 --> 00:07:53.630
They knew that what happened was

00:07:53.763 --> 00:07:54.430
likely to happen.

00:07:54.798 --> 00:07:56.199
So why did they do it?

00:07:56.332 --> 00:07:57.367
What's the message they were

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:58.268
trying to send?

00:07:58.401 --> 00:07:59.669
I have a feeling that they were

00:07:59.803 --> 00:08:01.771
probably trying to send a

00:08:01.905 --> 00:08:04.808
message that relates to our

00:08:04.908 --> 00:08:06.276
reconnaissance over China.

00:08:06.409 --> 00:08:09.512
We do reconnaissance over China,

00:08:09.646 --> 00:08:11.447
operating from international air

00:08:11.581 --> 00:08:11.748
space.

00:08:11.881 --> 00:08:13.616
They've never liked it.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.185
They've always threatened our

00:08:15.318 --> 00:08:16.452
planes as a result of that.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:18.822
I really think they were trying

00:08:18.822 --> 00:08:21.024
to send a larger message about

00:08:21.157 --> 00:08:23.426
what we do to gather information

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.228
on China.

